    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard because when i'm with people i'm always trying to find some color or some feeling, but it's never there. it's like i'm just waiting for something to happen that never does. sometimes i wonder if the only way to actually escape this numbness is to... i don't know. is it even possible to just make the grayness stop?",
